# Privacy Policy

**Last updated:** July 6, 2026

Welcome to **Stepz**.

Your privacy is important. This Privacy Policy explains what information Stepz collects, how it is used, and how it is protected.

---

# 1. Who We Are

Stepz is a mobile application designed to help users build habits, track skills, and record personal progress through simple daily activity tracking.

---

# 2. Information We Collect

## Local Data

Stepz stores the following information **locally on your device**:

- Activities and skills you create
- Activity history
- Text notes
- Voice notes
- Application settings
- Interface preferences

This information is **not transmitted to the developer**.

---

# 3. Personal Information

Stepz does **not** require:

- account registration;
- email address;
- phone number;
- name;
- location;
- contacts.

The application does not collect personally identifiable information unless explicitly stated in future updates.

---

# 4. Voice Notes

Voice recordings created inside Stepz are stored locally on your device.

If future versions introduce cloud speech recognition or synchronization, this Privacy Policy will be updated before those features become available.

---

# 5. Internet Connection

The core functionality of Stepz is designed to work **offline**.

An internet connection is not required for normal daily use.

---

# 6. Data Sharing

Stepz does not sell, rent, or share your personal data with third parties.

---

# 7. Data Security

Your data remains on your device.

While reasonable care has been taken during development, no software can guarantee absolute security. Users are encouraged to protect their devices using screen locks, encryption, and regular backups.

---

# 8. Children's Privacy

Stepz is not intended for children under the age of 13.

The application does not knowingly collect personal information from children.

---

# 9. Future Features

Future versions of Stepz may introduce optional online features such as:

- cloud synchronization;
- account creation;
- online speech recognition;
- backups across devices.

If any of these features are implemented, this Privacy Policy will be updated before they become available.

---

# 10. Changes to This Policy

This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time.

The latest version will always be available through the application's official Privacy Policy page.

---

